# oracle: kspace_modify keywords that native KSpace::modify_params reads for every style and plain pppm never uses
# (kmax/ewald, mix/disp, mesh/disp, order/disp, gewald/disp, force/disp/real, splittol, disp/auto, amat, wire with a
# neutral system), plus neigh_modify binsize -1 (native: a value <= 0 is the default bin size). The run must be the
# one without them.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-10
units lj
atom_style full
lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass * 1.0
set type 1 type/ratio 2 0.5 12345
set type 1 charge 1.0
set type 2 charge -1.0
velocity all create 1.0 87287 loop geom
pair_style lj/cut/coul/long 2.5
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0
kspace_style pppm 1e-4
kspace_modify kmax/ewald 4 4 4 mix/disp pair mesh/disp 8 8 8 order/disp 5 gewald/disp 0.3
kspace_modify force/disp/real 1e-4 splittol 0.5 disp/auto yes amat onestep wire 3.0
neigh_modify binsize -1 every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix 1 all nve
thermo_style custom step temp pe ecoul elong press pxx pyz
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 5
run 20
